WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.010
Tap + Line Item.

00:03.010 --> 00:08.250
Type the name. How many, size, one side or two, what it is.

00:08.250 --> 00:12.340
Pick the category. Yard signs are Outdoor Signage.

00:12.340 --> 00:18.100
Flat sign? Tap Flatbed. Banner or decal? Tap Roll Stock Prints. Then tap Next.

00:18.100 --> 00:20.500
Pick the material.

00:20.500 --> 00:24.300
Set the size. Set how many. One side or two.

00:24.300 --> 00:27.910
Your price shows here. Tap Save Changes.
